	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_planter_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ガラスに　さわると　ほんのりつめたい▼
ケースの　なかでは　しょくぶつが
かわいい　みを　つけてる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ガラスに　触ると　ほんのり冷たい▼
ケースの　中では　植物が
可愛い　実を　つけてる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・春用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>栽培ケース</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
